    "slug": "does-a-shed-need-a-foundation",
    "title": "Does a Shed Need a Foundation? What I Tell Homeowners Around Anne Arundel County",
    "description": "Can a shed sit right on the grass or on blocks? Bobby explains why sheds in Anne Arundel County clay need a real foundation, what counts as one, and what to check before it goes in.",
